    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPEEDRUNNING //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your aim, strafing, and routing to complete maps as quickly as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEADERBOARDS //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against yourself and against players all across the world in our global leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a diverse arsenal of your favourite weapons, with a responsive system built for skilled players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVEMENT //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players of the Source Engine games will be familiar with your strafe-heavy movement system, designed for a high skill ceiling, further enhancing difficulty and complexity.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPEEDRUNNING //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your aim, strafing, and routing to complete maps as quickly as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEADERBOARDS //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against yourself and against players all across the world in our global leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a diverse arsenal of your favourite weapons, with a responsive system built for skilled players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVEMENT //</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players of the Source Engine games will be familiar with your strafe-heavy movement system, designed for a high skill ceiling, further enhancing difficulty and complexity.</p>",
